__pycache__/
*.pyc
maps/
*.log
.idea/
# Machine-local Claude Code state. The .tmp.* files are atomic-write scratch —
# they appear and vanish, and one got swept into a commit by `git add -A`.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.tmp.*

# Run artifacts. logs/ holds two very different things: the diagnostic TOOLS
# (*.py), which are source and belong in git, and the OUTPUT of runs, which does
# not. run.txt/kill.txt/smoke.txt are terminal capture from background runs --
# run.txt alone reached 15,065 lines. The CSVs are real measurement data, but
# every claim they support is already written up in PHASE1.md with the numbers
# quoted; keeping 22 near-identical files to re-derive a table nobody will
# re-derive is bulk, not evidence. Force-add one with `git add -f` if a specific
# run ever needs preserving.
logs/*.csv
logs/run.txt
logs/kill.txt
logs/smoke.txt

# The YOLO weights. Stock YOLOv8n, ~6.5 MB, re-downloadable:
#   python3 -c "from ultralytics import YOLO; YOLO('yolov8n.pt')"
# Binary, not source, and not ours -- ./rover detect names the recovery.
models/*.pt
